#6100
The Great Western Road~
You are on a cobblestone road winding its way between the enormous, grey
trunks. The crowns of the trees must be very dense, as they leave the
forest floor in utter darkness. Grass is growing heavily over the cobblestones
and many of them are almost hidden from view. The road leads east and west.
~
